o the external ledger with no idempotency key. Calling it twice double-posts. Never add retries around it; use `f\u2026 (truncated; full text: get the id above)\\n- [convention] Money is integer cents, never float (id: 01a0f9fe-2a10-7263-8e96-08d6a6cbcce2; source: shared/human)\\n  All monetary amounts are stored and passed as integer cents using the `Money` type in src/billing/money.py. Never use float for money. Field names end in `_cent\u2026 (truncated; full text: get the id above)\",\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\"}}\n", "stderr": "", "exit_code": 0, "outcome": "success", "uuid": "2c39ecd0-e146-49a5-93be-46356fc6440d", "session_id": "a018787f-46b8-4ff9-a96c-636f9f5a9d64"}
